{"type":"text","timestamp":1787952443074,"sessionID":"ses_fb5dcd7a6ffeSGBPKFVeVpziRm","part":{"id":"prt_04a452a7d001CyrBDjefnf77oM","messageID":"msg_04a44f90e0012d3RS8w8UOGclp","sessionID":"ses_fb5dcd7a6ffeSGBPKFVeVpziRm","type":"text","text":"The only remaining change is `session.log` — this session's own live capture, which the host-side sweep commit handles at session end (per the architecture: \"Every job-worktree session ends with a host-side sweep-commit\"). Committing it myself would be committing a moving target. Everything else is committed.\n\nLet me run the complete test suite one final time to confirm the shipped state is green:","time":{"start":1787952441981,"end":1787952443070}}}
