{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787952465527,"sessionID":"ses_fb5ba93f2ffe9RBBAgSFG35dIN","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_a939d6d9592946578102e52e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git status"},"output":"On branch feature/farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\n\tmodified:   docs/jobs/farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path/session.log\n\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\n","metadata":{"output":"On branch feature/farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path\nChanges not staged for commit:\n  (use \"git add <file>...\" to update what will be committed)\n  (use \"git restore <file>...\" to discard changes in working directory)\n\tmodified:   docs/jobs/farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path/session.log\n\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"git status","time":{"start":1787952465524,"end":1787952465526}},"id":"prt_04a458637001f6rl7J6ixXHCgC","sessionID":"ses_fb5ba93f2ffe9RBBAgSFG35dIN","messageID":"msg_04a457541001Qv1cEyZgm2s8QW"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1787952465625,"sessionID":"ses_fb5ba93f2ffe9RBBAgSFG35dIN","part":{"id":"prt_04a457e200015mzc8kHBRhLdrc","messageID":"msg_04a457541001Qv1cEyZgm2s8QW","sessionID":"ses_fb5ba93f2ffe9RBBAgSFG35dIN","type":"text","text":"I'm the reviewer for this job. Let me start by reading the key files. The bash tool is restricted to git commands only, so let me run those carefully one at a time.","time":{"start":1787952463392,"end":1787952465609}}}
