{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787952473021,"sessionID":"ses_fb5ba93f2ffe9RBBAgSFG35dIN","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_90aa434a3c134f939c520e81","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git log --oneline --all -30"},"output":"bbd7531b [farmer] chore: commit all\nd9a0f23d web-ui: real-daemon verification fixes, README, and node_modules hygiene\n419603eb [farmer] implementation: add summary\n594bb428 TASK-15: update mg serve help text — the API is no longer read-only\n35ac7432 TASK-4: warn on edit-brief when the job branch has no registered worktree\n6bf245ba TASK-15: docs sync — mutating API, SSE stream, and ProjectLocks boundary in AGENTS.md/README/listener.md\nee4a4e68 TASK-14: ProjectLocks boundary verification (mutating serialize, launches/reads don't block)\nb5a27e86 TASK-13: extend security + credentials tests across the mutating surface\nda4cc8c9 TASK-6: stub launch.JdiExe in tests to avoid spawning the test binary recursively\nb196e141 TASK-12: SSE session-log stream tests (growth, from-offset, disconnect, shutdown drain)\n9ffa864f TASK-3..11: endpoint tests for the mutating API surface\na2a3b18e TASK-12: preserve http.Flusher through the audit middleware for SSE streams\nb29b2416 TASK-12: fix session-log stream compile errors and start-event payload\n6a0afdea [farmer] chore: commit all\n4b62eb0e [farmer] chore: commit all\n149d178d web-ui: Svelte control-plane client — scaffold, tokens, API layer, views, tests\n597934eb TASK-2: one-shot detached agent-run primitive in internal/session\n5217ebcf TASK-1: relocate session-log writer machinery into internal/job\nd0b9f86b [farmer] chore: commit all\ndce26df9 [farmer] brief: edit via TUI\n6427bd21 Scaffold job farmer_part-2-of-web-ui-tui-path\nc17938d4 Add blank line before TUI settings footer shortcut hint\n878f3add Fix TUI settings tab order to match top-to-bottom render order\n77aaae09 change config structure for mg serve\n69f7cc72 add jq to tailing\nc7e303f5 stuff\na8847fd5 Fix t