never the token); and the git-mutating operations\n+(create, edit-brief, done, delete, push, orphan-delete) serialize per project\n+root via the `serve.ProjectLocks` pattern — while launch-agent, launch-jdi,\n+prune and every read endpoint deliberately do NOT take the lock, so a job\n+launch never waits behind an unrelated merge.\n \n ---\n \n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"git diff main...HEAD -- README.md","time":{"start":1787952737020,"end":1787952737022}},"id":"prt_04a49aaa40013T4TvM3zmbEWdq","sessionID":"ses_fb5ba93f2ffe9RBBAgSFG35dIN","messageID":"msg_04a4985060010TWD2oaM5ESRCa"}}
